{"id":228,"flavor":[{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"They make repeated eerie howls before dawn to call attention to their pack."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It cooperates with others skillfully. When it becomes your partner, it’s very loyal to you as its Trainer and will obey your orders."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Houndour hunt as a coordinated pack. They communicate with each other using a variety of cries to corner their prey. This Pokémon’s remarkable teamwork is unparalleled."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"To corner prey, they check each other’s location using barks that only they can understand."},{"games":["X","Crystal"],"text":"Around dawn, its ominous howl echoes through the area to announce that this is its territory."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It uses different kinds of cries for communicating with others of its kind and for pursuing its prey."},{"games":["Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It conveys its feelings using different cries. It works in a pack to cleverly take down prey."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"It uses different kinds of cries for communicating with others of its kind and for pursuing prey."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"HOUNDOUR communicate with each other using a variety of cries to corner their prey. This POKéMON’s remarkable teamwork is simply unparalleled."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Early Bird","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon awakens from sleep twice as fast as other Pokémon."},{"name":"Flash Fire","hidden":false,"description":"If hit by a Fire-type move, the Pokémon absorbs the flames and uses them to power up its own Fire-type moves."},{"name":"Unnerve","hidden":true,"description":"Unnerves opposing Pokémon and makes them unable to eat Berries."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"